egative number. Hence, the result will be negative.\n\nTherefore, since \n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{8}÷\\frac{1}{6}=\\frac{3\\times 6}{8\\times 1}=\\frac{18}{8}=\\frac{9}{4},\n$$\n\nwe obtain\n\n$$\n(-\\frac{3}{8})÷\\frac{1}{6}=-\\frac{9}{4}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186483393 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186179800 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "15f1aff4-68c4-5acf-9de0-ad34e321ef3f" :knowledge-point/title "Dividing With Negative Fractions"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "424b2dd8-9b73-548c-b7cc-4ca500b6b156" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{5}{6}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186482924} {:answer/id #uuid "6f8353d3-9579-5c1e-8802-4ea1bdff86fd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186483004} {:answer/id #uuid "ab0fb722-71f0-5f53-8b20-486ab4bacd00" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{5}{6}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186483102} {:answer/id #uuid "cd695a82-2dbd-573c-8f41-021965ec84e2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{4}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186483154} {:answer/id #uuid "ce613343-8043-5bc1-ae12-aad3ccc46878" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{2}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186483158}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6f8353d3-9579-5c1e-8802-4ea1bdff86fd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186483004} :answer-field/id #uuid "7774d184-d47b-5051-8e81-b32b977ef33a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186483285}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "ab43471e-dafe-5dcf-b8bc-06037ed994ac" :question/math-academy-id "q-128062" :question/problem "Determine the value of $(-\\frac{1}{5})÷(-\\frac{3}{10}).$" :question/worked-solution "Dividing a negative number by a negative number gives a positive number. Hence, the result will be positive.\n\nTherefore, since \n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{5}÷\\frac{3}{10}=\\frac{1\\times 10}{5\\times 3}=\\frac{10}{15}=\\frac{2}{3},\n$$\n\nwe obtain\n\n$$\n(-\\frac{1}{5})÷(-\\frac{3}{10})=\\frac{2}{3}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186483354 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186179799 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "57266531-c68d-57d9-b136-9d100dcc983e" :knowledge-point/title "Dividing With Negative Whole Numbers and Fractions"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9ee4d24e-23ef-5ad1-93ac-34b77b84473c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{5}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186483080}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9ee4d24e-23ef-5ad1-93ac-34b77b84473c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{5}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186483080} :answer-field/id #uuid "b44317ba-2764-5aaf-a2ac-d25521c85278" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186483310}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "2ad85a11-bba5-5fae-afa8-bc7f058da66c" :question/math-academy-id "q-173783" :question/problem "Expressed as an improper fraction in its simplest form,  $(-6)÷\\frac{12}{5}=${{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "Dividing a negative number by a positive number gives a negative number. Hence, the result will be negative.\n\nTherefore, since \n\n$$\n6÷\\frac{12}{5}=\\frac{6\\times 5}{12}=\\frac{30}{12}=\\frac{5}{2},\n$$\n\nwe obtain\n\n$$\n(-6)÷\\frac{12}{5}=-\\frac{5}{2}.\n$$"}]}
